  "title": "Bass‑Reactive Cube Ring Visualizer",
  "kind": "blender",
  "summary": "Creates a Blender scene where the bass frequencies of ~/Music/track.wav drive the emission strength of a ring of 32 cubes. The scene includes a bloom‑style glow in the compositor and a slow camera push‑in that lasts the entire track.",
